---
// "Open data → platform technology → infrastructural AI → civic enquiry":
// four panels updating the Platform Urbanism infographic (Barns 2020) in the
// drawing-study register. Each panel is its own SVG so the grid stacks on a
// phone; the captions are real text and carry the narrative.
//
// Restored from the rendered page after an accidental truncation, so the
// drawing is static markup rather than generated from data.
---
<figure class="shift"> <h3 class="shift-title">Open data <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="sr"> to </span> platform technology <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="sr"> to </span> infrastructural AI <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="sr"> to </span> civic enquiry</h3> <div class="panels"> <!-- 1. Open data --> <div class="panel"> <svg viewBox="20 30 280 216" role="img" aria-labelledby="p1t p1d"> <title id="p1t">Open data</title> <desc id="p1d">The public record, drawn as a bar, publishes outward: arrows fan up to five open circles, the people who can read it.</desc> <defs> <marker id="a1" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#7D50BD"></path> </marker> </defs> <path d="M110,194 Q85,163 60,104" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a1)"></path><path d="M135,194 Q121.5,147 108,72" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a1)"></path><path d="M160,194 Q160,141 160,60" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a1)"></path><path d="M185,194 Q198.5,147 212,72" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a1)"></path><path d="M210,194 Q235,163 260,104" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a1)"></path> <circle cx="60" cy="92" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="108" cy="60" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="160" cy="48" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="212" cy="60" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="260" cy="92" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="70" y="196" width="180" height="18" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> <text x="160" y="236" class="lbl">PUBLIC RECORD</text> </svg> <p class="p-name"><span>1</span>Open data</p> <p class="p-cap">The open data movement was built on the premise that data transparency would lead to greater accountability. Governments published, and the public record became more readable than ever.</p> </div> <!-- 2. Platform capture --> <div class="panel"> <svg viewBox="20 30 280 216" role="img" aria-labelledby="p2t p2d"> <title id="p2t">Platform technology</title> <desc id="p2d">Open data from the public record and data from people both funnel into a dark platform bar with a padlock. Only thin dashed lines return to people.</desc> <defs> <marker id="a2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#E076DB"></path> </marker> </defs> <!-- open data funnelled up into the platform --> <path d="M80,204 Q120,180 148,152" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="12" stroke-opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M240,204 Q200,180 172,152" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="12" stroke-opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M120,198 Q140,176 152,154" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path> <path d="M200,198 Q180,176 168,154" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path> <!-- people's data captured --> <path d="M60,103 Q110,121 135,124" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path><path d="M108,71 Q134,105 147,124" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path><path d="M160,59 Q160,99 160,124" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path><path d="M212,71 Q186,105 173,124" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path><path d="M260,103 Q210,121 185,124" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a2)"></path> <!-- services back, thin --> <path d="M110,130 Q90,112 66,102" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></path> <path d="M210,130 Q230,112 254,102" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></path> <circle cx="60" cy="92" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="108" cy="60" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="160" cy="48" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="212" cy="60" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="260" cy="92" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="92" y="126" width="136" height="24" fill="#1f1d24"></rect> <text x="160" y="142" class="lbl lbl-inv">PLATFORM</text> <!-- padlock --> <g transform="translate(236,124)"> <path d="M3,8 V5 a5,5 0 0 1 10,0 V8" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></path> <rect x="0" y="8" width="16" height="13" rx="2" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g> <rect x="70" y="200" width="180" height="16" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> <text x="160" y="238" class="lbl">PUBLIC RECORD</text> </svg> <p class="p-name"><span>2</span>Platform technology</p> <p class="p-cap">Instead, much of that open data fed platform technologies that built closed data ecosystems on it, and on the data people gave them, behind hidden algorithms and paywalls. Legibility gathered with the platforms, not the public.</p> </div> <!-- 3. Frontier models --> <div class="panel"> <svg viewBox="20 30 280 216" role="img" aria-labelledby="p3t p3d"> <title id="p3t">Infrastructural AI</title> <desc id="p3d">The public record and the public web both funnel up into a purple frontier model, backed by a faint, dashed data centre. A coin marks a subscription instead of a padlock. From the model, many small tools fan out.</desc> <defs> <marker id="a3" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#1f1d24"></path> </marker> <marker id="a3p" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#E076DB"></path> </marker> </defs> <!-- everything public, hoovered up --> <path d="M58,202 Q110,176 140,152" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="16" stroke-opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M262,202 Q210,176 180,152" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="16" stroke-opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M100,198 Q130,176 148,154" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a3p)"></path> <path d="M220,198 Q190,176 172,154" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a3p)"></path> <!-- tools, abundant --> <g> <path d="M160,118 L61.44,106.4" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="43" y="93" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L82.56,78.24" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="67" y="61" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L110.72,60.64" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="99" y="41" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L140.64,53.6" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="133" y="33" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L179.36,53.6" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="177" y="33" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L209.28,60.64" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="211" y="41" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L237.44,78.24" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="243" y="61" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L258.56,106.4" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="267" y="93" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g><g> <path d="M160,118 L160,76.48" fill="none" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#a3)"></path> <rect x="155" y="59" width="10" height="10" rx="2" fill="#fff" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="2"></rect> </g> <rect x="102" y="118" width="116" height="32" rx="6" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> <text x="160" y="138" class="lbl lbl-inv">FRONTIER MODEL</text> <!-- the data centre behind it, in a community, harder to see --> <g transform="translate(40,140)"> <rect x="0" y="0" width="34" height="34" fill="#f3f0f5" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></rect> <line x1="6" y1="9" x2="28" y2="9" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></line> <line x1="6" y1="17" x2="28" y2="17" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></line> <line x1="6" y1="25" x2="28" y2="25" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></line> <line x1="34" y1="12" x2="62" y2="-6" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3"></line> </g> <text x="57" y="188" class="note">data centre</text> <!-- subscription, not a lock --> <circle cx="230" cy="122" r="9" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <text x="230" y="126" class="coin">$</text> <rect x="40" y="200" width="112" height="16" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> <rect x="168" y="200" width="112" height="16" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-dasharray="4 2" stroke-width="2"></rect> <text x="96" y="236" class="lbl">PUBLIC RECORD</text> <text x="224" y="236" class="lbl">PUBLIC WEB</text> </svg> <p class="p-name"><span>3</span>Infrastructural AI</p> <p class="p-cap">Frontier AI models have since absorbed public data at far greater scale. The paywall is different, a subscription rather than a lock, and the tools they enable are far more abundant. The infrastructure behind them, including data centres arriving in communities, is governed in ways that are harder to see.</p> </div> <!-- 4. Civic enquiry --> <div class="panel"> <svg viewBox="20 30 280 216" role="img" aria-labelledby="p4t p4d"> <title id="p4t">Civic enquiry</title> <desc id="p4d">People, now filled in purple, each have a small agent beside them. Dotted lines from the agents reach into a faint, dashed governance box and down to the public record, and purple arrows bring what they find back up.</desc> <defs> <marker id="a4" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#7D50BD"></path> </marker> </defs> <!-- governance, harder to see --> <rect x="100" y="118" width="120" height="40" fill="#f3f0f5" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3"></rect> <text x="160" y="136" class="lbl lbl-faint">GOVERNANCE</text> <text x="160" y="150" class="note">harder to see</text> <!-- agents reach into governance, and down to the record --> <path d="M228,86 Q214,108 196,128" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M76,86 Q96,108 116,128" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <g> <path d="M76,98 Q84,144 92,196" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M78,194 Q69,153 60,104" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a4)"></path> </g><g> <path d="M176,54 Q212,122 168,196" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M154,194 Q127,131 160,60" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a4)"></path> </g><g> <path d="M244,98 Q236,144 228,196" fill="none" stroke="#E076DB" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <path d="M214,194 Q237,153 260,104" fill="none" stroke="#7D50BD" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#a4)"></path> </g> <g> <circle cx="60" cy="92" r="9" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="72" y="88" width="7" height="7" transform="rotate(45 75.5 91.5)" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></rect> </g><g> <circle cx="108" cy="60" r="9" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="120" y="56" width="7" height="7" transform="rotate(45 123.5 59.5)" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></rect> </g><g> <circle cx="160" cy="48" r="9" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="172" y="44" width="7" height="7" transform="rotate(45 175.5 47.5)" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></rect> </g><g> <circle cx="212" cy="60" r="9" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="224" y="56" width="7" height="7" transform="rotate(45 227.5 59.5)" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></rect> </g><g> <circle cx="260" cy="92" r="9" fill="#7D50BD" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></circle> <rect x="272" y="88" width="7" height="7" transform="rotate(45 275.5 91.5)" fill="#E076DB" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="1.2"></rect> </g> <rect x="70" y="196" width="180" height="18" fill="#fff" stroke="#1f1d24" stroke-width="2"></rect> <text x="160" y="236" class="lbl">PUBLIC RECORD</text> </svg> <p class="p-name"><span>4</span>Civic enquiry</p> <p class="p-cap">Where trust in how digital infrastructure is governed is breaking down, Civic Interplay builds on what open data investment created, and asks what becomes possible when active citizens enlist AI agents in acts of civic enquiry. The aim is to move data-driven enquiry beyond specialist knowledge, towards everyday knowledge practices, citizen sensing and open forums, and to seek shared benefits from digital infrastructure in more accountable ways.</p> </div> </div> <figcaption class="shift-key"> <span><i class="k k-purple"></i> legibility, flowing to people</span> <span><i class="k k-pink"></i> data captured, or agents reading</span> <span><i class="k k-agent"></i> an AI agent</span> <span><i class="k k-tool"></i> a tool built on a model</span> </figcaption> </figure>

<style>
.shift {margin:1.75rem 0 3.5rem!important; padding:1.4rem 1.4rem 1.2rem; background:#fff; border:2px solid var(--border); box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--purple)}
.shift-eyebrow {font-family:var(--heading)!important; font-size:var(--fs-label)!important; font-weight:var(--w-medium)!important; letter-spacing:var(--track-label); text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--purple); margin:0 0 .3rem!important}
.shift-eyebrow em {font-style:italic; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0}
.sr {position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0 0 0 0); white-space:nowrap}
.shift-title {font-family:var(--heading); font-size:var(--fs-lead); font-weight:var(--w-bold); margin:0 0 1rem}
.panels {display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.75rem 1.5rem}
.panel svg {display:block; width:100%; height:auto}
.panel .lbl {font-family:var(--heading); font-size:11px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.14em; text-anchor:middle; fill:#1f1d24}
.panel .lbl-inv {fill:#fff}
.panel .lbl-faint {fill:#1f1d2499}
.panel .note {font-family:var(--body); font-style:italic; font-size:10.5px; text-anchor:middle; fill:#1f1d2499}
.p-name {display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; font-family:var(--heading)!important; font-weight:var(--w-bold)!important; font-size:var(--fs-body)!important; margin:.4rem 0 .3rem!important}
.p-name span {display:inline-grid; place-items:center; width:1.4rem; height:1.4rem; border-radius:50%; background:var(--purple); color:#fff; font-size:.75rem}
.p-cap {font-family:var(--body)!important; font-weight:var(--w-light)!important; font-size:.9rem!important; line-height:1.6!important; margin:0!important}
.shift-key {display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.4rem 1.4rem; margin-top:1.1rem; padding-top:.8rem; border-top:1px solid var(--border-light); font-family:var(--heading); font-size:.75rem; color:var(--text-dim)}
.k {display:inline-block; width:18px; height:0; vertical-align:middle; margin-right:.35rem}
.k-purple {border-top:2px solid var(--purple)}
.k-pink {border-top:2px dashed var(--pink)}
.k-agent {width:8px; height:8px; background:var(--pink); border:1px solid var(--border); transform:rotate(45deg)}
.k-tool {width:9px; height:9px; border:2px solid var(--purple); border-radius:2px; background:#fff}
.panel .coin {font-family:var(--heading); font-size:10px; font-weight:700; text-anchor:middle; fill:#1f1d24}
@media(max-width:700px) {.panels {grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:1.5rem}
.panel svg {max-width:360px}
}

</style>
